-corporation-umc-q2-2021-ea/"},{"c":"UMC 2021 Q3","e":"umc","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Qi Dong Liu","x":"Total equity is about TWD257 billion, as we continue to rise on both price increase as well as mix improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/united-microelectronics-corporation-umc-q3-2021-ea/"},{"c":"UMC 2021 Q3","e":"umc","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Wang","x":"And the -- both the ASP momentum will be a combination of the product mix improvement as well as the pricing momentum, yes, the price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/united-microelectronics-corporation-umc-q3-2021-ea/"},{"c":"UMC 2026 Q2","e":"umc","d":"2026-07-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jason Wang","x":"The overall addressable market is projected to more than double by 2030 in our addressable market because it expanded from the 2.5D interposer with DTC, discrete DTC, 3D wafer to wafer stacking which that's what you're referring to the RFSOI and the memory to memory stacking as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/umc-umc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"UMC 2026 Q2","e":"umc","d":"2026-07-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jason Wang","x":"Now, we have -- like you said, we have already entered production for the 3D wafer-of-wafer hybrid bonding, bridge die and discrete DTC, but they will follow by the wafer-to-wafer stacking as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/umc-umc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"UMC 2026 Q2","e":"umc","d":"2026-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jason Wang","x":"Within the AI data center, while growth in compute and memory will remain high, we also see the connectivity and power also growing at a high CAGR, driven by the need for more bandwidth and more efficient power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/umc-umc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"UMC 2026 Q2","e":"umc","d":"2026-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jason Wang","x":"What we see is really coming from, one, PC was strongest driver of inventory buildup as the AI infrastructure build cycle is still ongoing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/umc-umc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"UMC 2026 Q2","e":"umc","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Charlie Chan","x":"So with that kind of impact your kind of negotiation with customers to passing through the cost because you're kind of increasing your investments, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/umc-umc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"UMC 2026 Q2","e":"umc","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chi-Tung Liu","x":"And the key question I want to ask is that how should we think about your margin trajectory going forward and the pricing power this time versus the last up cycle?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/umc-umc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"UMC 2026 Q3","e":"umc","d":"2026-10-28","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jason Wang","x":"Under our current expansion roadmap, we are targeting monthly capacity approximately 18,000 wafers for silicon photonics, 22,000 for DTC and silicon capacitor, and 20,000 for TFLN modulators.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/umc-umc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"UMC 2026 Q3","e":"umc","d":"2026-10-28","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jason Wang","x":"For AI and server application, our substrate embedded DTC solution has completed tape-out and functional verified.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/umc-umc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"UMC 2026 Q3","e":"umc","d":"2026-10-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jason Wang","x":"Meanwhile, silicon photonic